/-- My Paint
| 
| The my_paint project is a simple paint program written in C using CSFML that allows you to draw on a window.
|
| The project contains many features such as:
| - Brushs and erasers
| - Color picker
| - Color palette
| - Save and load
| - File explorer
|
| A file explorer is also available to open and save files, so you can load any image and draw on it.
|
| If you want to save this loaded image, it will be saved on the same file, by overwriting it.
| 
| The brush configuration allow you to change the size of the brush, the hardness and the opacity.
| 
| In the case of the eraser, the hardness and the opacity are not used, but the size is.
| 
| the eraser is also a brush, but with a transparent color and infinite hardness.
|
| the color palette is coded using vectors, so all the 256bits colors is available.
|
| if you still have any questions, feel free to contact me.
|
| my email is written in the about section of the program.
|
\-- Have fun!
